      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, left",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>according to his situation. Also, from the beginning</li>\n<li>after their/our arrival (in Aden), his intent was to deceive</li>\n<li>regarding everyone's letters. And it may be said</li>\n<li>that I did not bring a letter.</li>\n<li>Rather, someone else is bringing them,</li>\n<li>even the letters of Yosef and Khalaf</li>\n<li>and everyone (else), and R. Ya\u02bfaqov's letter</li>\n<li>as well, as he ordered, if there was one.</li>\n<li>Then they all dispersed.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>(continued on recto, right)</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
